#: ../../usage.md:1
msgid "快捷上传"
msgstr "Quick upload"

#: ../../usage.md:3
msgid "网页之外，sapic 还能被桌面工具、编辑器直接调用。所有方式走的都是同一个上传接口， 区别只在「谁发起请求」。先准备一个令牌："
msgstr ""
"Outside the web UI, sapic can be called directly by desktop tools and "
"editors. Every route uses the same upload endpoint — only who initiates the"
" request differs. Start by creating a token:"

#: ../../usage.md:6
msgid "登录站点，进入 **设置 → 访问令牌**，点「新建令牌」；"
msgstr "Sign in, open **Settings → Access tokens** and click New token;"

#: ../../usage.md:7
msgid "作用域只勾 **上传图片**（`upload`）即可，客户端不需要读、写或管理权限；"
msgstr ""
"tick only the **Upload images** (`upload`) scope — clients need no read, "
"write or admin permission;"

#: ../../usage.md:8
msgid "需要把客户端的图片固定收进某个相册时，在「默认相册」里选一个——客户端不会带 `album_id`，令牌会替你补上（相册被删后自动回落到你的默认相册）；"
msgstr ""
"to pin client uploads into one album, pick it under Default album — clients"
" never send `album_id`, the token fills it in (and falls back to your "
"default album once that album is deleted);"

#: ../../usage.md:10
msgid "令牌只在创建时显示一次（形如 `sp_xxxxxxxx`），下面统一写作 `<PAT>`。"
msgstr ""
"The token is shown only once at creation (like `sp_xxxxxxxx`); it is "
"written `<PAT>` below."

#: ../../usage.md:13
msgid "浏览器的登录会话不能直接当 API 令牌用：会话请求必须带 CSRF 头，客户端带不了。 这也是为什么所有客户端都要求配置 PAT。"
msgstr ""
"A browser session cannot be used as an API token: session requests must "
"carry a CSRF header, which clients cannot send. That is also why every "
"client needs a PAT."

#: ../../usage.md:17
msgid "上传接口速查"
msgstr "Upload endpoint at a glance"

#: ../../usage.md:19
msgid ""
"所有客户端都打同一个端点：`POST /api/v2/upload`（`multipart/form-data`，字段 `file` 或 `url`，"
" 可带 `album_id` / `title` / `expire`），鉴权用请求头 `Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`， "
"成功返回 **HTTP 201**，图片地址取 `data.image.src`。"
msgstr ""
"Every client hits the same endpoint: `POST /api/v2/upload` (`multipart"
"/form-data`, field `file` or `url`, optionally `album_id` / `title` / "
"`expire`), authenticated with `Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`; success "
"returns **HTTP 201** and the image URL is in `data.image.src`."

#: ../../usage.md:30
msgid "字段含义、响应结构、错误码与 URL 抓取的限制见[API 参考](api.md)的上传一节； 下面是各客户端的逐项配置。"
msgstr ""
"Field meanings, response shape, error codes and the URL-fetch restrictions "
"are in the upload section of the [API reference](api.md); below is the per-"
"client setup."

