#: ../../usage.md:49
msgid "PicGo-Core（命令行）"
msgstr "PicGo-Core (command line)"

#: ../../usage.md:51
msgid "PicGo 桌面版的底层就是 PicGo-Core，很多编辑器插件也调用它。只想要命令行上传时："
