msgstr ""
"The `customHeader` and `customBody` values are **stringified JSON** — mind "
"the escaping. Then:"

#: ../../usage.md:84
msgid ""
"只是偶尔在命令行传几张图的话，用 [sapicli](cli.md) 更省事：不用装 Node、不用写配置文件， `-u` / `-t` "
"直接给地址和令牌，`-c md` 还能顺手把链接放进剪贴板。"
msgstr ""
"If you only upload a few images from the command line now and then, "
"[sapicli](cli.md) is easier: no Node, no config file, `-u` / `-t` take the "
"address and token directly, and `-c md` drops the link into your clipboard."

