msgid "JSON 路径 `$.data.image.src`"
msgstr "JSON path `$.data.image.src`"

#: ../../usage.md:130
msgid ""
"响应是上面那层统一包装，`src` 藏在 `data.image.src`。老版本 ShareX 只支持正则时， 用 "
"`\"src\"\\s*:\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"` 也能取到——JSON 里只有 `data.image.src` 这一处 `src` 键 "
"（`tpl.HTML` 里的地址是 `src='...'`，单引号，不会被这条正则命中）。"
msgstr ""
"The response uses the envelope above, so `src` sits in `data.image.src`. "
"Old ShareX versions that only support regex can use "
"`\"src\"\\s*:\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"` — the JSON contains only one `src` key "
"(`tpl.HTML` uses `src='...'` with single quotes, which the regex does not "
"match)."

#: ../../usage.md:134
msgid "编辑器插件（VS Code / Obsidian）"
msgstr "Editor plugins (VS Code / Obsidian)"

#: ../../usage.md:136
msgid "这类插件多数只是调用 PicGo 或 PicGo-Core，**图床配置沿用上文即可**，插件里只需要指到可执行文件："
msgstr ""
"Most of these plugins just call PicGo or PicGo-Core, so **the host "
"configuration above applies**; the plugin only needs the executable path:"

#: ../../usage.md:138
msgid ""
"VS Code：安装 PicGo 相关扩展（如 `PicGo`、`Markdown Image`），设置里填 `picgo` 的路径； "
"保存/粘贴图片时自动上传并插入 Markdown。"
msgstr ""
"VS Code: install a PicGo-related extension (such as `PicGo` or `Markdown "
"Image`) and set the `picgo` path in its settings; saving or pasting an "
"image uploads it and inserts Markdown."

#: ../../usage.md:140
msgid ""
"Obsidian：安装 `Image auto upload` 插件，上传器选 PicGo 或 PicGo-Core， 同样读取 "
"`~/.picgo/config.json`。"
msgstr ""
"Obsidian: install the `Image auto upload` plugin and choose PicGo or PicGo-"
"Core as the uploader — it also reads `~/.picgo/config.json`."

#: ../../usage.md:143
msgid "Typora"
msgstr "Typora"

#: ../../usage.md:145
msgid "Typora 的上传服务有三种接法，任选其一："
msgstr "Typora can be wired up in three ways; pick one:"

#: ../../usage.md:147
msgid "**PicGo**：上传服务选 **PicGo**，填 `picgo` 的可执行文件路径，图床配置见上面 PicGo 一节。"
msgstr ""
"**PicGo**: choose **PicGo** as the upload service and point it at the "
"`picgo` executable; the host config is the PicGo section above."

#: ../../usage.md:148
msgid ""
"**sapicli**：上传服务选 **Custom Command**，命令填 `sapicli -u https://your.site -t "
"<PAT> -s typora \"$@\"` —— `-s typora` 的输出正好是 Typora 要的格式；`sapicli` v0.6.0 "
"起支持 v2，用法见[命令行工具](cli.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**sapicli**: choose **Custom Command** and enter `sapicli -u "
"https://your.site -t <PAT> -s typora \"$@\"` — `-s typora` produces exactly"
" the format Typora wants; `sapicli` has supported v2 since v0.6.0, see "
"[Command line tool](cli.md)."

#: ../../usage.md:151
msgid "**自带脚本**：见下，不用装任何工具，只要一条能把文件传上去并输出 URL 的命令。"
msgstr ""
"**Bundled script**: see below — no extra tools, just one command that "
"uploads a file and prints the URL."

#: ../../usage.md:153
msgid ""
"方式三的脚本存成 `/usr/local/bin/sapic-upload` 并 `chmod +x`（Windows 用后面 「Windows "
"右键菜单」里的 `.cmd`）："
msgstr ""
"Save the third script as `/usr/local/bin/sapic-upload` and `chmod +x` it "
"(on Windows use the `.cmd` from the Windows context menu section below):"

#: ../../usage.md:168
msgid ""
"然后在 Typora **偏好设置 → 图像**：插入图片时选「上传图片」，上传服务选 **Custom Command**， 命令填 "
"`/usr/local/bin/sapic-upload \"$@\"`（或用上面第 2 种的 `sapicli ...`）， "
"点「验证图片上传选项」确认可用。"
msgstr ""
"Then in Typora **Preferences → Image**: choose to upload images on insert, "
"set the upload service to **Custom Command** and enter `/usr/local/bin"
"/sapic-upload \"$@\"` (or the `sapicli ...` form from option 2), and click "
"the upload-verification button to confirm."

#: ../../usage.md:173
msgid "需要在正文里插入 Markdown 而不是裸链接时，把最后一行换成输出 `![](url)` 的写法即可；Typora 只要求每次上传输出一行文本。"
msgstr ""
"To insert Markdown instead of a bare link, replace the last line with one "
"that prints `![](url)`; Typora only needs one line of text per upload."

#: ../../usage.md:176
msgid ""
"脚本用 `python3` 解析 JSON（macOS 由 Xcode 命令行工具提供）。机器上没有 `python3` 时，改用 "
"`jq`：把管道末尾换成 `| jq -r '.data.image.src // empty'`，记得先 `brew install jq`。"
msgstr ""
"The script parses JSON with `python3` (provided by the Xcode command line "
"tools on macOS). Without `python3`, use `jq` instead: replace the tail of "
"the pipeline with `| jq -r '.data.image.src // empty'` (run `brew install "
"jq` first)."

