#: ../../usage.md:256
msgid "油猴脚本"
msgstr "Userscript"

#: ../../usage.md:258
msgid ""
"浏览器里 Alt（或 Ctrl）+ 点击任意网站的图片就能直接上传。先在 **设置 → 个性化** 打开 「油猴脚本」开关，用同一行右侧的安装地址装到"
" Tampermonkey，首次上传时粘贴一个只含 `upload` 的 PAT 即可（脚本源码里不含任何令牌，令牌存在脚本管理器本地）。"
msgstr ""
"Alt (or Ctrl) + click any image on any site to upload it. First enable the "
"userscript switch under **Settings → Personalisation** and install it into "
"Tampermonkey from the address on the right of that row; paste a PAT with "
"only the `upload` scope on the first upload (the script source contains no "
"token — it is stored locally by the script manager)."

